      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Text to Video · MiniMax H3\n\n**Geekatplay Studio** · ComfyUI-Cluster\n\nType what should happen and what it should sound like. The planner turns it into a shot-by-shot description with audio, and MiniMax H3 renders video and sound together.\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Start Ollama.\n2. Describe the action **and the sound** in **Ollama Prompt Planner**.\n3. Set `length` on the H3 node (124 frames is about 5 seconds).\n4. Press **Run**.\n\n## Reading the graph\n\nGroups run left to right and are numbered in the order they execute. The **Status** row at the bottom shows what the planner decided and what the loader did.\n\n## If something fails\n\n- **Model not installed**: the loader error lists the exact files and download links. Run `install.bat`.\n- **Planner says tag matching**: Ollama was not reachable or the model tag is not pulled. The workflow still runs; the summary shows the reason.\n"
      ],
      "title": "About this workflow",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
