      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Models\n\n**MiniMax H3** makes video and matching stereo sound in one pass: voices, effects and music.\n\n## Files\n\n- `models/diffusion_models/`\n  [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) (21 GB)\n- `models/text_encoders/`\n  [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) (15.7 GB)\n- `models/vae/`\n  [minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors) (2.8 GB)\n- `models/vae/`\n  [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) (0.6 GB)\n\n`install.bat` downloads all four. About 40 GB in total; plan for a 24 GB GPU (estimate).\n\n## Settings used\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Steps | 20 |\n| Sampler | res_multistep, simple |\n| Size | 768 px short edge, up to 1344 x 768 |\n| Length | 124 frames = about 5 s at 24 fps |\n\nThese follow the official ComfyUI MiniMax H3 text-to-video template.\n\n## Length\n\n`length` on the H3 node is in frames. Valid values are 5, 22, 39, ... in steps of 17. The model was trained for about 124 to 362 frames (5 to 15 s).\n\n## Faster drafts\n\nThe registry also lists **FastVideo FastH3 8-step**. To use it, disable the base H3 entry in `model_registry.json` (or install only FastH3) and add a *ModelSamplingMiniMaxH3* node with video shift 10 after the loader.\n\n## Ollama\n\n```\nollama pull qwen3.5:9b\n```"
      ],
      "title": "Models and setup",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
  ],
